Data Science Process
Imagine you have been working for a consultancy company for several years and have some analytics experience under your belt. 
A data science project has just been assigned to you by your boss. Using the CRISP-DM process as a guide, 
what would be your course of action from start to finish? Write your course of action in a short paper. 
Use CRISP-DM as guidance for the step by step process but also feel free to add your own flair to it. 
Provide as many details as you can for each and every step of the CRISP-DM process. 
Make sure to identify the risks involved in each step. 
